# SHOP.CO

This is a simple online clothing shop website made with HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

The website has different sections where users can look at products, add products to the cart and see some information about the shop.

## Features

* Home page
* Product sections
* New arrivals
* Top selling products
* Shopping cart
* Search bar
* Product ratings
* Customer reviews
* Different clothing styles
* Newsletter section
* Footer with company information

## Technologies

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript


## Project Files

* `index.html` - main page
* `main2.css` - styles for the page
* `main2.js` - JavaScript functions
* `cart.html` - shopping cart page
* `README.md` - project information

## How to Run

Open the `index.html` file in a web browser.

No additional installation is needed.

## About

The project was made as a practice website for learning HTML, CSS and JavaScript and for creating a simple online clothing store.
